# Thuka Flutter Rules

Follow all rules in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repository root.

## Project adapters (quick reference)

| Use this in rules/docs | Use this in Thuka code |
|------------------------|--------------------------|
| `FontPalette` / font palette | `lib/res/styles/font_palette.dart` |
| `PrimaryButton` | `lib/utils/common_widgets/primary_button.dart` |
| `CommonTextFormField` | `lib/utils/common_widgets/common_text_form_field.dart` |
| Package imports | `package:thuga/...` |
| Strings / colors | `Strings.` / `ColorPalette.` from `res/` |

## Non-negotiables

- Feature structure: `model/`, `state/`, `notifier/`, `repo/`, `view/`
- Riverpod code gen with `@Riverpod(keepAlive: false)` by default
- Freezed `sealed` state classes
- `LoaderState` for API-backed features; `handleResponseError` on errors
- Repositories return `Either<ResponseError, T>`
- Controllers (`TextEditingController`, etc.) live in notifiers
- `ref.watch(...select(...))` for granular rebuilds
- No hardcoded strings, colors, or inline `TextStyle` in UI
- ScreenUtil suffixes: `.h`, `.w`, `.r`, `.verticalSpace`, `.horizontalSpace`
- Shared widgets from `utils/common_widgets/` — never raw `Scaffold`, `AppBar`, etc.
